The Cognizant® Intelligence Lab as a Service Offering Deck - for Jul22 references a hybrid model strategy across Azure OpenAI, Anthropic, and self-hosted options, plus guardrails, RBAC, workload identities, audit logging, multi-tenant isolation, and region pinning. [Cognizant®...for Jul22 | PowerPoint]

